#: scenario7:scenario7_924161D0_BAEC_48AD_9DC5_167596F0F25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e806e0911cdb6de29787ee7e4489fc596a2acf294b38210ab9ff794394d994b
