#: scenario7:scenario7_D0618942_835E_4499_BE41_A2C78CFFBF9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 907655d200e0beb923caceeb11ec62ee08df136d33dfe7f7658eb645157b5bfe
