#: scenario7:scenario7_423131A6_FDB2_4843_A2D2_366A47EDE7AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f73f14b80f67eb35a8017e39ebc45941c3d9bbf433dc434bbbfea6fff420fc5c
